{"ticker":{"symbol":"090360.KQ","name":"로보스타","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":55100.0,"change_pct":0.011009174311926495,"market_cap":537225003008.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":47050.0,"week52_high":171600.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Ansan-si","employees":175,"website":"https://www.robostar.co.kr","business_summary":"Robostar Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells motion robots in South Korea and internationally. It provides robotic products and solutions. The company also offers cartesian, articulated, SCARA, parallel, mobile, and glass and water transfer robots, as well as linear actuators; and controller for linear actuator, multiple axis robot, transfer robot, and teach pedant. In addition, it provides industrial equipment, including electronics, semiconductor, display, and battery. The company was founded in 1999 and is headquartered in Ansan-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)로보스타는 국내 및 해외에서 모션로봇을 제조, 판매하고 있습니다. 로봇 제품 및 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 직교형, 관절형, SCARA, 평행형, 이동식, 유리 및 물 이송 로봇과 선형 액추에이터를 제공합니다. 리니어액츄에이터, 다축로봇, 트랜스퍼로봇, 티치페던트용 컨트롤러 등을 포함하고 있습니다. 또한 전자, 반도체, 디스플레이, 배터리 등 산업장비도 공급하고 있다. 1999년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 안산시에 위치하고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":143240218460.0,"operating_income":1794247690.0,"net_income":3281878090.0,"eps":337.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":102679156140.0,"operating_income":1135968770.0,"net_income":693544230.0,"eps":71.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":89140364460.0,"operating_income":148546300.0,"net_income":2217180980.0,"eps":227.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":75735139040.0,"operating_income":-5660781160.0,"net_income":-5200635440.0,"eps":-533.0}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":null,"rating